# =========================
# Data files ONLY (not code)
# =========================
*.csv
*.parquet
*.json

# BUT keep python source code
!**/*.py
!**/__init__.py

# ...and the hand-maintained CONFIG files, which are inputs, not outputs.
# manual_basis.csv survived only because it was tracked before the *.csv rule
# existed; manual_adjustments.csv was silently skipped by `git add -A` and
# never reached Pi 1, so the reconciliation appeared to do nothing.
# Pattern, not a list of names: listing them individually already failed twice
# -- manual_adjustments.csv and then manual_transactions.csv were each silently
# skipped by `git add -A`, never reached Pi 1, and made the fix look like it had
# done nothing.
!manual_*.csv
!corporate_actions.json

